abstract.haxe_doc:
An abstract over the list of `Segment`s. Alternative representation of a polygon.
Segments must be connected to form a complete polygonal shape. Provides a more efficient distance calculus.
@see `h2d.Polygon`

containsPoint.haxe_doc:
